        "created_at": "2019-02-27T17:56:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I may be alone in this, but is anyone else here a Pokemon fan?</p>\n<p>Nintendo released a small Direct on YouTube today regarding the first main title Pokemon game on the Nintendo Switch:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oOPVBm0sA7Q\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oOPVBm0sA7Q</a></p>\n<p>We have a title, a look and name for the region the game takes place in,&nbsp;the names and looks of this gen's starters, and a release window of late this year(Guaranteeing a boost in Switch sales around this year's holiday season).</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:30.865Z",
